# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide describes migration paths for the most important feature changes in Qiskit v1.0, organized by module.\n"
"Use the table of contents on the right side to navigate to the module you are interested in.\n"
msgstr ""
"Esta guía describe los caminos de migración para los cambios de características más importantes en Qiskit v1.0, organizados por módulo.\n"
"Usa la tabla de contenidos del lado derecho para navegar al módulo que te interesa.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit v1.0 migration tool {#qiskit-v10-migration-tool}"
msgstr "Herramienta de migración de Qiskit v1.0 {#qiskit-v10-migration-tool}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To ease the migration process, you can use the\n"
"[`flake8-qiskit-migration`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration)\n"
"tool to detect removed import paths in your code and suggest alternatives.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para facilitar el proceso de migración, puedes usar la herramienta\n"
"[`flake8-qiskit-migration`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration)\n"
"para detectar rutas de importación eliminadas en tu código y sugerir alternativas.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-pipx\" label=\"Run with pipx\" default>\n"
"      If you have [`pipx`](https://github.com/pypa/pipx) installed, simply run\n"
"      the following command.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-pipx\" label=\"Ejecutar con pipx\" default>\n"
"      Si tienes [`pipx`](https://github.com/pypa/pipx) instalado, simplemente ejecuta\n"
"      el siguiente comando.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      pipx run flake8-qiskit-migration <path-to-source-directory>\n"
"      ```\n"
"      This will install the package to a temporary virtual environment and run\n"
"      it on your code.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-venv\" label=\"Run with venv\" default>\n"
"      If you don't want to use `pipx`, you can manually create a new\n"
"      environment for the tool. This approach also lets you use\n"
"      [`nbqa`](https://github.com/nbQA-dev/nbQA) to check code examples in\n"
"      Jupyter notebooks. Delete the environment when you're finished.\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      pipx run flake8-qiskit-migration <path-to-source-directory>\n"
"      ```\n"
"      Esto instalará el paquete en un entorno virtual temporal y lo ejecutará\n"
"      sobre tu código.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-venv\" label=\"Ejecutar con venv\" default>\n"
"      Si no quieres usar `pipx`, puedes crear manualmente un nuevo\n"
"      entorno para la herramienta. Este enfoque también te permite usar\n"
"      [`nbqa`](https://github.com/nbQA-dev/nbQA) para revisar ejemplos de código en\n"
"      notebooks de Jupyter. Elimina el entorno cuando termines.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      # Make new environment and install\n"
"      python -m venv .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      source .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv/bin/activate\n"
"      pip install flake8-qiskit-migration\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      # Make new environment and install\n"
"      python -m venv .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      source .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv/bin/activate\n"
"      pip install flake8-qiskit-migration\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # Run plugin on Python code\n"
"      flake8 --select QKT100 <path-to-source-directory>  # e.g. `src/`\n"
msgstr ""
"      # Run plugin on Python code\n"
"      flake8 --select QKT100 <path-to-source-directory>  # e.g. `src/`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # (Optional) run plugin on notebooks\n"
"      pip install nbqa\n"
"      nbqa flake8 ./**/*.ipynb --select QKT100\n"
msgstr ""
"      # (Optional) run plugin on notebooks\n"
"      pip install nbqa\n"
"      nbqa flake8 ./**/*.ipynb --select QKT100\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # Deactivate and delete environment\n"
"      deactivate\n"
"      rm -r .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"      # Deactivate and delete environment\n"
"      deactivate\n"
"      rm -r .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limitations\">\n"
"This tool only detects removed import paths. It does not detect the use of removed\n"
"methods (such as `QuantumCircuit.qasm`) or arguments. It also can't keep track\n"
"of assignments such as `qk = qiskit`, although it can handle aliases such as\n"
"`import qiskit as qk`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limitaciones\">\n"
"Esta herramienta solo detecta rutas de importación eliminadas. No detecta el uso de métodos\n"
"eliminados (como `QuantumCircuit.qasm`) ni de argumentos. Tampoco puede rastrear\n"
"asignaciones como `qk = qiskit`, aunque sí puede manejar alias como\n"
"`import qiskit as qk`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more information, see the [project's\n"
"repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration).\n"
msgstr ""
"Para más información, consulta el [repositorio del\n"
"proyecto](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration).\n"

