# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.tools.events` module and the `progressbar()` utility it exposed\n"
"have been removed. This module's functionality was not widely used and is\n"
"better covered by dedicated packages such as\n"
"[tqdm](https://github.com/tqdm/tqdm).\n"
msgstr ""
"El módulo `qiskit.tools.events` y la utilidad `progressbar()` que exponía han\n"
"sido eliminados. La funcionalidad de este módulo no era ampliamente utilizada y\n"
"está mejor cubierta por paquetes dedicados como\n"
"[tqdm](https://github.com/tqdm/tqdm).\n"

